  "title": "Ping Identity Support: SAML, OIDC, and SCIM",
  "summary": "PropelAuth now supports Ping Identity across all three of the standards that matter most for enterprise customers: SAML, OIDC, and SCIM. Ping is one of the most established identity providers in the enterprise, and it's a common requirement for companies in finance, healthcare, and other regulated industries. If you're selling B2B SaaS upmarket, \"Do you support Ping?\" is exactly the kind of question that shows up in a security questionnaire right when a deal is heating up. Now the answer is yes",
